# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Melghat RSV genomics -- scripts only. NO participant data, NO sequences,
# NO result tables derived from them.
#
# This repository is deliberately code-only. The analysis reads identifiable
# cohort data (ari.csv, demographics.csv, lrtideaths.csv, GPS household
# coordinates) and viral genome sequences that are not ours to publish here.
# The rule below is allowlist-style: everything is ignored, then scripts are
# added back, so a new data file in a new folder is excluded by default
# rather than by remembering to add a rule.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ignore everything
*

# ...then allow directories to be descended into
!*/

# ...and allow only code and documentation
!.gitignore
!README.md
!scripts/**/*.R
!scripts/**/*.py
!scripts/**/*.sh
!contextual/*.sh
!contextual/ADD_2021_22_CONTEXT.md
!SENSITIVITY_PLAN.md

# belt and braces: never commit these, even if a rule above is loosened
data/
output/
freeze/
nextclade/
manuscript/
contextual/*.fasta
contextual/*.nwk
contextual/*.csv
contextual/inform/
contextual/reference/
*.csv
*.tsv
*.dta
*.rds
*.fasta
*.fa
*.nwk
*.docx
*.pdf
*.png
*.xlsx
*.zip
*.gz
.DS_Store
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
__pycache__/
